flowchart LR
    A[Image tensor H x W x C] --> B[Conv + ReLU]
    B --> C[Pooling / downsample]
    C --> D[Stacked conv blocks]
    D --> E[Feature maps]
    E --> F{Task}
    F -- Classification --> G[Global pool + softmax]
    F -- Detection --> H[Region proposals + boxes]
    F -- Segmentation --> I[Per-pixel mask]
    F -- Modern --> J[Patch embed -> ViT]
    G --> K[Evaluate: accuracy / mAP / IoU]
    H --> K
    I --> K
    J --> G
